===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|twerc}}, from {{inh|de|goh|twerc}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*dwergaz}}. The development Middle High German ''tw-'' > modern German ''zw-'' is regular. Compare Dutch {{m|nl|dwerg}}, English {{m|en|dwarf}}, Danish {{m|da|dværg}}.

